msgstr "Live-Transkription"

#: src/ui/settings/dictation.rs:235
msgid "Show tentative text in the main window while you are still speaking (Whisper only). Does not apply to the mini panel — that always uses a clean batch decode. The final result is always the full-accuracy decode."
